# USB Hardware Testing Checklist

## 🔹 General USB Identification

👉 **Use RegShot to monitor registry changes**

### ⭐ Identify USB Devices Connected to Your System

#### **On Linux:**
```bash
lsusb
lsusb -v
```
#### **On Windows:**
- Open **Device Manager** (`devmgmt.msc`).
- Expand **Universal Serial Bus controllers**.

